{#
  « Informations de paiement » — the third card of « Finances » (chantier
  #927, §2.4 and §2.6).

  While money is due: the beneficiary, the IBAN, the one communication,
  the amount to pay at this stage and the SEPA QR of that transfer — the
  same block the renter reads on their tracking page, enlargeable to be
  scanned from the screen. Without an IBAN on the account there is no QR
  and the page says why; with nothing due it says that too.

  Once something is owed back — a validated settlement leaving the
  security deposit to give back, an abandoned booking that had been paid
  — « À rembourser »: the transfer is made from the bank, with the
  booking's communication, and the import reconciles it on its own.
  « Rapprocher le remboursement » is the way back for a transfer that
  left without it: the debits Finance offers as candidates — when, how
  much, to whom, nothing else — and the one picked becomes the refund.
  Its form posts without JavaScript's help (`data-async="off"`): the
  page comes back whole, the dialog closed.

  Requires `booking`, `asset`, `booking_page`, `payment`, `instructions`
  (RentalPaymentService::paymentInstructions(), or null),
  `refund_candidates` and `refund_since`.
#}
{% set overpaid = payment.overpaid_cents|default(0) %}
<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5 mb-3">Informations de paiement</h2>
        <div data-booking-panel="payment-instructions">
            {% if overpaid > 0 %}
                <div class="alert alert-warning small" data-finance-refund>
                    <strong>À rembourser au locataire : {{ overpaid|money_cents }}</strong> — faites le virement
                    depuis la banque vers le compte d'où le locataire a payé, en indiquant la communication
                    <span class="font-monospace text-nowrap">{{ payment.communication }}</span> : il sera rapproché
                    automatiquement à l'import de l'extrait.
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary w-100 w-sm-auto"
                        data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#rapprocher-remboursement">
                    Rapprocher le remboursement
                </button>
                <p class="small text-body-secondary mt-2 mb-0">
                    « Rapprocher » sert si le virement est parti sans la communication : le site propose les
                    débits non rapprochés de ce compte, d'au plus {{ overpaid|money_cents }}, depuis le
                    {{ refund_since|date_fr }}.
                </p>
            {% elseif instructions is null and payment.tracked|default(false) %}
                {# Payments switched off on the asset after the receivable
                   was raised: nothing more is asked of the renter — no QR,
                   no amount, here or on their page — but Finance still
                   reconciles the communication, and a surplus still reads
                   « À rembourser » above. #}
                <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-0" data-finance-payments-off>
                    Les paiements de ce bien sont désactivés : rien n'est demandé au locataire, ni QR code ni
                    montant à verser. Les virements portant la communication
                    <span class="font-monospace text-nowrap">{{ payment.communication }}</span> restent rapprochés
                    de cette réservation.
                </p>
            {% elseif instructions is null %}
                <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-0" data-finance-no-receivable>
                    La communication structurée est créée avec le premier contrat, qui l'imprime : les
                    informations de paiement s'affichent ici dès qu'il est généré.
                </p>
            {% elseif instructions.amount_cents <= 0 %}
                <p class="mb-2" data-finance-nothing-due>Rien n'est à verser pour l'instant.</p>
                <dl class="row small mb-0">
                    <dt class="col-sm-5">Communication</dt>
                    <dd class="col-sm-7 font-monospace text-break mb-0">{{ instructions.communication }}</dd>
                </dl>
            {% else %}
                {% include '@rental/_payment_details.html.twig' with {
                    instructions: instructions, qr_dialog_id: 'qr-paiement',
                } only %}
                {% if instructions.iban is null %}
                    <p class="alert alert-secondary small mt-3 mb-0" data-finance-no-iban>
                        Le compte associé à ce bien n'a pas d'IBAN dans les Finances : ni QR code ni compte à
                        indiquer au locataire. Un chef d'unité le complète depuis les Finances.
                    </p>
                {% endif %}
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

{# The dialogs sit outside the card: a modal nested in one inherits its
   stacking context. Each in a panel of its own, so its amounts follow
   the page's refresh. #}
<div data-booking-panel="payment-dialogs">
    {% if overpaid <= 0 and instructions and instructions.qr_data_uri %}
        {% include '@rental/_payment_qr_dialog.html.twig' with {
            instructions: instructions, qr_dialog_id: 'qr-paiement',
        } only %}
    {% endif %}

    {% if overpaid > 0 %}
        {% embed 'partials/modal.html.twig' with {
            id: 'rapprocher-remboursement',
            title: 'Rapprocher le remboursement',
            asset: asset, booking: booking, booking_page: booking_page,
            overpaid: overpaid, refund_since: refund_since, refund_candidates: refund_candidates,
        } only %}
            {% block body %}
                {% if refund_candidates is empty %}
                    <p class="mb-0" data-refund-candidates-empty>
                        Aucun débit non rapproché de ce compte, d'au plus {{ overpaid|money_cents }}, depuis le
                        {{ refund_since|date_fr }}. Un virement fait aujourd'hui apparaît après l'import de
                        l'extrait qui le contient.
                    </p>
                {% else %}
                    <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/remboursement-rapprocher" id="refund-form"
                          data-async="off">
                        {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                        <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                        <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                        <input type="hidden" name="booking_page" value="{{ booking_page.value }}">
                        <p class="small">
                            Débits non rapprochés du compte, d'au plus {{ overpaid|money_cents }}, depuis le
                            {{ refund_since|date_fr }}. Celui que vous choisissez est enregistré dans les Finances
                            comme le remboursement de cette réservation. Aucun e-mail n'est envoyé.
                        </p>
                        <div class="table-responsive">
                            <table class="table table-sm align-middle mb-0" data-refund-candidates>
                                <caption class="visually-hidden">Débits candidats au remboursement</caption>
                                <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th scope="col"><span class="visually-hidden">Choix</span></th>
                                        <th scope="col">Date</th>
                                        <th scope="col">Contrepartie</th>
                                        <th scope="col" class="text-end">Montant</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    {% for candidate in refund_candidates %}
                                        <tr>
                                            <td>
                                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="transaction_id"
                                                       id="refund-candidate-{{ candidate.transactionId }}"
                                                       value="{{ candidate.transactionId }}" required
                                                       {{ loop.first ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="text-nowrap">
                                                <label for="refund-candidate-{{ candidate.transactionId }}">
                                                    {{ candidate.date|date_fr }}
                                                </label>
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="text-break">{{ candidate.counterpartyName ?? '—' }}</td>
                                            <td class="text-end text-nowrap">-{{ candidate.amountCents|money_cents }}</td>
                                        </tr>
                                    {% endfor %}
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                {% endif %}
            {% endblock %}
            {% block footer %}
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Annuler</button>
                {% if refund_candidates is not empty %}
                    <button type="submit" form="refund-form" class="btn btn-primary">Rapprocher</button>
                {% endif %}
            {% endblock %}
        {% endembed %}
    {% endif %}
</div>
